<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-16T11:50:32.210Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:50:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels seized a major town in eastern DRC, violating a ceasefire, while ADF gunmen killed dozens of civilians in Ituri province amid the Ebola outbreak. The UN mission reinforced its presence in eastern DRC as unpaid wages and fighting stalled the Ebola response, which has reached a death toll of 5,387. Scores of Christians were killed in recent terror attacks and private military contractors are cited as a risk to mineral security. The Francophonie summit postponed the vote on a new leader after a dispute between DR Congo and Rwanda, and five EU countries announced a scheme to deport irregular migrants to Rwanda. The conflict accounted for 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261116-francophonie-summit-postpones-new-leader-vote-amid-dr-congo-rwanda-dispute&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/ce4e5b88-f7f6-4aaa-aa29-aed46b99f065?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNVUtwQ00wRnhmV1NzcW42ZUZteE50OG1rMFo3YV9kclpIY18xdk9OOVFiSjJRVVU2Q1Zmb1hxOC1xekplMmE1ckxXNHhFbHJEeGRQT1piWURlYU5pdUo1akM2SHR6UzFwUGxQVnRyRWJSZGJ5UUJRdURnSDdrM2VOMGNVc0Q0NG82b1Vr?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPUlNKa1czLUlvUUJzZkNRNlUwamRMX3FJWGc5X0lSNjQ5Wjl3TjhVNkpaVHYtdy1BdU9EV3F1ajJ4cXg3clVDdzRyTFNVUVhmUTZoNWcxQU5wTUx6UExfcHpyTGFuX1Y3b3Z3WTVNN0w1aDJWMXBDM3kzcmw5a3h5VVh3eDc2RU5sbm1qN1ZIbGdacVNTazVrU0FzWkxpaUw3eXVsZEtQc0ZPcG5EaXRwX2NGSkc0aVN1UndYRHp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNV1RpbGtoLUQwTU82UVpJelIxVTJrUjNYbG04ZmlhSWYwckxveC02NF9NYklvU0FwYnJsX3c3Z181X0ZjV01nZjdhMmlBcUxLSnhPRGpjMjgtR2dyWmZPUjdKdlZPdklsNWF